    "controller_support": "full",
    "detailed_description": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline crossorigin=\"anonymous\" poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1921330/extras/bc241e6e567c0d9396e7095f11869228.poster.avif?t=1754448587\" ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1921330/extras/bc241e6e567c0d9396e7095f11869228.webm?t=1754448587\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"></video></div><strong>Echo Wars</strong> is a VR arcade game that doesn\u2019t waste your time: you jump into your buggy, grab your weapon, and everything starts blowing up. Drive with one hand, shoot with the other, and get ready for a series of spectacular levels featuring giant enemies, extreme environments, and mechanics that evolve in every stage.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline crossorigin=\"anonymous\" poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1921330/extras/e0daf140fe81bc4be0acad98a9b24f60.poster.avif?t=1754448587\" ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1921330/extras/e0daf140fe81bc4be0acad98a9b24f60.webm?t=1754448587\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"></video></div>From collapsing futuristic cities to icy landscapes crawling with lethal creatures, through volcanic tunnels, space circuits, egg-infested laboratories, and cursed mines\u2014there\u2019s no pause here, only well-orchestrated chaos. And if you\u2019re looking for a real challenge, Brutal Mode will make you sweat like it\u2019s the arcade glory days.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Echo Wars is compatible with both VR and flat screens (including Steam Deck), and it\u2019s perfect for short bursts of adrenaline or full-blown arcade marathons.</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\"><div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline crossorigin=\"anonymous\" poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1921330/extras/3d849049d17b5697ba6ebcdf93d619eb.poster.avif?t=1754448587\" ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1921330/extras/3d849049d17b5697ba6ebcdf93d619eb.webm?t=1754448587\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"></video></div><strong>Features:</strong></h2><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Innovative anti-rotation system that completely eliminates motion sickness in VR.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Compatible with force feedback wheels and motion platforms (PC exclusive).</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Playable in VR or on flat screens, with support for ultra-widescreen and Steam Deck.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Unique mechanic: drive with one hand and shoot with the other.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">16 levels with varied objectives and three difficulty settings.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Original soundtrack composed by Ricardo Ferm\u00edn.</p></li></ul>",
    "about_the_game": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline crossorigin=\"anonymous\" poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1921330/extras/bc241e6e567c0d9396e7095f11869228.poster.avif?t=1754448587\" ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1921330/extras/bc241e6e567c0d9396e7095f11869228.webm?t=1754448587\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"></video></div><strong>Echo Wars</strong> is a VR arcade game that doesn\u2019t waste your time: you jump into your buggy, grab your weapon, and everything starts blowing up. Drive with one hand, shoot with the other, and get ready for a series of spectacular levels featuring giant enemies, extreme environments, and mechanics that evolve in every stage.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline crossorigin=\"anonymous\" poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1921330/extras/e0daf140fe81bc4be0acad98a9b24f60.poster.avif?t=1754448587\" ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1921330/extras/e0daf140fe81bc4be0acad98a9b24f60.webm?t=1754448587\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"></video></div>From collapsing futuristic cities to icy landscapes crawling with lethal creatures, through volcanic tunnels, space circuits, egg-infested laboratories, and cursed mines\u2014there\u2019s no pause here, only well-orchestrated chaos. And if you\u2019re looking for a real challenge, Brutal Mode will make you sweat like it\u2019s the arcade glory days.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Echo Wars is compatible with both VR and flat screens (including Steam Deck), and it\u2019s perfect for short bursts of adrenaline or full-blown arcade marathons.</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\"><div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline crossorigin=\"anonymous\" poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1921330/extras/3d849049d17b5697ba6ebcdf93d619eb.poster.avif?t=1754448587\" ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1921330/extras/3d849049d17b5697ba6ebcdf93d619eb.webm?t=1754448587\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"></video></div><strong>Features:</strong></h2><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Innovative anti-rotation system that completely eliminates motion sickness in VR.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Compatible with force feedback wheels and motion platforms (PC exclusive).</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Playable in VR or on flat screens, with support for ultra-widescreen and Steam Deck.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Unique mechanic: drive with one hand and shoot with the other.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">16 levels with varied objectives and three difficulty settings.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Original soundtrack composed by Ricardo Ferm\u00edn.</p></li></ul>",
    "short_description": "Drive with one hand and shoot with the other in this explosive VR arcade game. Echo Wars delivers instant action, no motion sickness thanks to its anti-rotation system, giant bosses, visual chaos, and gameplay as over-the-top as it is fun.",
